Press conference at the Council of the EU for the lauching of the Euro.
From left to right:

Sauli Niinistö, Finnish Minister for Finance;
Carlo Azeglio Ciampi, Italian Minister for the Tresory, Budget and Economic planning;
Werner Müller, German Federal Minister for Economy and Technology;
Yves-Thibault de Silguy, Member of the EC in charge of Economic and financial affairs and monetary matters;
Wim Duisenberg, President of the European Central Bank;
Rudolf Edlinger, Austrian Federal Minister for Finance;
Jacques Santer, President of the EC;
Jean-Claude Juncker, Luxembourgish Prime Minister and Minister for Finance;
Dominique Strauss-Kahn, French Minister for Economy, Finance and Industry;
Gerrit Zalm, Dutch Minister for Finance;
Jean-Jacques Viseur, Belgian Minister for Finance;
António Sousa Franco, Portuguese Minister for Finance;
Rodrigo de Rato y Figaredo, Spanish Minister for Economy and Finance
